        "TileImage": "$($repository 247d3f8f-b482-4dcc-95b3-58d2c0ef72fd).Image",
        "Description": "June 15th, 2006.\r\rHey 47, this is Angelo Corleone, the boss of Corleone family. This reguest is personal. The targets are five of my former business associates; Carmine Falco, Arturo Gimenez, Emilio LaSalle, Tren Po &amp; a congressman who is in on it; Leviticus Walsh. These five guys are out of a total of 90 of my former associates &amp; soldati who killed my younger brother Lucciano back in 2000. And my older brother Louis &amp; my younger brother Tommaso &amp; all of their men a few days ago. Kill them all.",
